        "topic_1": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery & Returns"
          }
        },
        "q_2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "When can I expect my order?",
            "a": "<p>Deliveries across Denmark typically arrive within two working days. Place your order by 2 PM on weekdays, and we’ll ship it out the same day from Brøndby.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How much does delivery cost?",
            "a": "<p>Nothing at all! Our delivery is completely free across Denmark, whether it is to a parcel shop, a locker, or directly to your door.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is your return policy?",
            "a": "<p>You are welcome to return your items within 14 days for a refund. We simply ask that the pieces remain unused and in their original condition.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I change or cancel my order?",
            "a": "<p>If you happen to change your mind on a purchase, please contact us straight away at hello@echobyjmg.com.</p><p>We can still process changes or cancellations as long as your order hasn't been packed, which is usually within one hour of placement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do you ship outside Denmark?",
            "a": "<p>EchoByJMG is proud to begin our journey in Denmark. At launch, we ship exclusively within Denmark, allowing us to deliver your order quickly and with care.</p><p>We’re preparing to extend delivery to other Scandinavian countries and across the EU in the near future. Join our Cozy Club or follow us for updates!</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_7": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is your packaging sustainable?",
            "a": "<p>Our packaging is thoughtfully crafted from recycled materials. It is designed to be easily reused, such as for a return shipment, while ensuring your pieces arrive beautifully and safely.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_9": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Yarn & Quality"
          }
        },
        "q_10": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What does \"rescued yarn\" mean?",
            "a": "<p>Rescued yarn is the pristine, luxury surplus left behind by fashion houses at the end of each season. This material is set aside strictly due to excess quantity, not a lack of quality. We rescue this premium surplus and reimagine it into exclusive new designs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_11": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Does using \"rescued yarn\" affect quality?",
            "a": "<p>Not at all. This yarn was spun for premium fashion brands and meets the highest industry standards. It is left behind solely because of excess quantity, never quality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_12": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why are your pieces limited edition?",
            "a": "<p>Because we only knit with rescued yarn, our production is naturally capped by the exact weight of each batch we recover. Once that yarn is gone, the design can never be reproduced. Every piece is individually numbered on its label, such as 7 of 12, marking its unique place in that single batch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_13": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can you restock a piece once it sells out?",
            "a": "<p>Exact restocks are rarely possible, as our production depends entirely on what is available. We might occasionally re-release the same design in a different colorway, but if that's not your thing, then be sure to secure your favorite piece before it's gone.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_14": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why are colours sometimes limited?",
            "a": "<p>We only knit with the rescued yarn available, so small batches naturally mean small runs. Once a shade is finished, we may never find that exact colour again.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_15": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will the colours look exactly the same in person?",
            "a": "<p>We photograph as accurately as we can; small differences can come from lighting, screens, and yarn blends.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_16": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Where are your products made?",
            "a": "<p>Every piece is crafted in our family-owned knitwear factory in Dongguan, China, backed by our parent company JM Group Limited. Keeping production entirely in-house ensures our strict standards for craftsmanship, quality control, and responsible production.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_17": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Are your products ethically made?",
            "a": "<p>Yes! We believe beautiful products should be made responsibly.</p><p>Our production is supported by recognised standards and ongoing accountability. We work in line with BSCI social compliance principles, helping promote fair working conditions and responsible manufacturing practices.</p><p>We also work with certified material standards including OCS (Organic Content Standard) and RCS (Recycled Claim Standard) where applicable, supporting greater transparency and traceability in our supply chain.</p><p>Beyond production, we are proud to support WWF Hong Kong as part of our wider commitment to environmental responsibility.</p><p>We continue to improve our practices across materials, production, and packaging as we grow.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_18": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Care"
          }
        },
        "q_19": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How should I care for my knitted piece?",
            "a": "<p>We recommend airing your knits often and washing them sparingly. When a wash is needed, gently hand wash in cold water and lay flat to dry to preserve the silhouette. You can explore our full Size &amp; Care Guide for detailed rituals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_20": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do your cushion covers come with the inner cushion?",
            "a": "<p>We offer our knitted covers individually so you can pair them with your preferred filling and level of firmness. All covers are tailored to fit a 45 x 45 cm inner cushion.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_21": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Gifting"
          }
        },
        "q_22": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Why give EchoByJMG as gifts?",
            "a": "<p>EchoByJMG pieces are thoughtful gifts with beauty, comfort, and meaning behind them.</p><p>All of our collections are made in limited quantities using premium leftover yarns, making each gift feel more personal and unique.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_23": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Will the price be shown on the packaging?",
            "a": "<p>No printed prices are included in the order. Order confirmations and receipts are sent digitally to the purchaser only. This means your recipient can enjoy the surprise fully without having to worry about price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_24": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Do you offer gift wrapping?",
            "a": "<p>Every order is thoughtfully wrapped in our custom-designed tissue paper and includes a small surprise from us. Whether you are gifting a piece to someone else or treating yourself, we ensure every EchoByJMG unboxing feels truly special.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_25": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I send it straight to the recipient?",
            "a": "<p>Yes, you can. Simply put your desired address into the form as you check out, and your order will be delivered accordingly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_26": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What is the latest date I can order to ensure my gifts arrive before Christmas?",
            "a": "<p>To ensure your pieces arrive in time for the holidays, please place your order by December 19th. During the festive season, carrier volumes are exceptionally high, so we recommend ordering early to avoid any delivery delays.</p>"
          }
        }
